+| Ping | `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` → `config('services.discord.mention_id')`: optional Discord user snowflake (17–20 digits) appended to every alert as `<@ID>` on its own line so the on-call person gets a push notification. Empty/invalid = no mention. |
